WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:06.000
[Two lava fountains roar]

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[A deep, steady roar]

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:31.000
[The fountain roars]

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:40.500
[Night. The fountain roars]

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:47.500
[Roaring, at real speed under slowed picture]

00:00:47.500 --> 00:01:04.500
[The fountain roars]

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:22.500
[A distant roar]

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:37.300
[No sound was recorded here. A low rumble from episode 44 plays under the timelapse]

00:01:37.300 --> 00:01:42.300
[Silence]
